\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Combine an optimized schedule of bridging densities, minimizing successive $\alpha$-divergences, with a class of bridging densities and a parametrized transport map $T$ for which the contraction factor $\omega<1$ is guaranteed at every step. \href{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2025/10}{[S2]}
\paragraph{Source status.}
